            "value" : "Cada link serve para uma pessoa e vale por 7 dias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each project has notes, so you and Claude know what it’s for." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.welcome.points.2.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes Projekt hat Notizen, damit du und Claude wisst, wofür es gedacht ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada proyecto tiene notas para que tú y Claude sepáis para qué sirve."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque projet a des notes pour que Claude et vous sachiez à quoi il sert."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ogni progetto ha delle note, così tu e Claude sapete a cosa serve."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elk project heeft notities, zodat jij en Claude weten waar het voor is."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada projeto tem notas, para você e o Claude saberem para que ele serve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each project has notes, so you and your agents know what it’s for." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.welcome.points.2.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
