    "If this agent takes the place of one you connected before, pick it. That agent stops working." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.prompts.items.agentReplaces.message. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dieser Agent einen zuvor verbundenen ersetzt, wähle ihn aus. Der andere Agent stellt seine Arbeit ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si este agente sustituye a uno que ya habías conectado, selecciónalo. El otro agente dejará de trabajar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si cet agent remplace un agent déjà connecté, sélectionnez-le. L’ancien agent cessera de fonctionner."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se questo agente sostituisce uno che avevi già connesso, selezionalo. L’altro agente smetterà di funzionare."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze agent een eerder verbonden agent vervangt, kies die dan. Die andere agent wordt gedeactiveerd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se este agente vai substituir um que você já conectou, selecione-o. O outro agente deixará de funcionar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you prefer not to keep a subscription, one payment covers seven years of Septena Plus across your devices, for the price of three annual years. When the seven years end, your tasks stay on your devices, and you can extend, move to a free account, or export everything. Support for running the open-source sync server on your own Cloudflare account is on the roadmap." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.pass.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If you prefer not to keep a subscription, one payment covers seven years of Septena Plus across your devices. That works out to half the annual rate. When the seven years end, your tasks stay on your devices, and you can extend, move to a free account, or export everything. Support for running the open-source sync server on your own Cloudflare account is on the roadmap." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.pass.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If you skip this, your tasks stay on this device until you sign in." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.account.footnote. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du diesen Schritt überspringst, bleiben deine Aufgaben auf diesem Gerät, bis du dich anmeldest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si omites este paso, tus tareas permanecerán en este dispositivo hasta que inicies sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si vous ignorez cette étape, vos tâches resteront sur cet appareil jusqu’à votre connexion."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se salti questo passaggio, le tue attività resteranno su questo dispositivo finché non effettui l’accesso."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je dit overslaat, blijven je taken op dit apparaat staan totdat je je aanmeldt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se você pular isto, suas tarefas ficam neste dispositivo até você entrar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you subscribe during the trial, billing starts on the day you subscribe." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.paywall.trialBilling. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du während des Testzeitraums abonnierst, beginnt die Abrechnung am Tag des Abonnements."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si te suscribes durante la prueba, el cobro empezará el día de la suscripción."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si vous vous abonnez pendant l’essai, la facturation commence le jour de votre abonnement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se sottoscrivi l’abbonamento durante la prova, l’addebito inizia il giorno della sottoscrizione."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je je tijdens de proefperiode abonneert, begint de facturering op de dag waarop je je abonneert."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se você assinar durante o período de teste, a cobrança começa no dia da assinatura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your browser showed an 8-character code, enter it here. Only enter a code from a window you opened yourself." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.claude_connector.codeHint.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dein Browser einen 8-stelligen Code angezeigt hat, gib ihn hier ein. Gib nur einen Code aus einem Fenster ein, das du selbst geöffnet hast."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tu navegador mostró un código de 8 caracteres, introdúcelo aquí. Introduce solo un código de una ventana que hayas abierto tú."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si votre navigateur a affiché un code de 8 caractères, saisissez-le ici. Ne saisissez un code que depuis une fenêtre que vous avez ouverte vous-même."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se il browser ha mostrato un codice di 8 caratteri, inseriscilo qui. Inserisci solo un codice da una finestra che hai aperto tu."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je browser een code van 8 tekens heeft getoond, vul die dan hier in. Vul alleen een code in uit een venster dat je zelf hebt geopend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se o navegador mostrou um código de 8 caracteres, digite-o aqui. Só digite um código de uma janela que você mesmo abriu."
