      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Prices include UK VAT. Outside EUR, USD, GBP and BRL, the App Store and Google Play charge their matching local price." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.currencies.2.footnote. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Prices include VAT where it applies. In the US, prices are the same numbers in USD plus applicable local sales tax. Elsewhere, the App Store and Google Play charge their matching local price." : {
