    "Prices include VAT where it applies. Outside EUR, USD, GBP and BRL, the App Store and Google Play charge their matching local price." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.currencies.0.footnote. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Prices include VAT where it applies. Outside the euro area, the App Store and Google Play charge their matching local price." : {
