    "Use a device where Septena is already signed in. It approves this one with a code, and your tasks sync here." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.accountDevice.body. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
